    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start the journey</h2>.The prologue is set before the story of the main game Soulbind: Tales Of The Underworld. You will learn where your hero's journey began, how he met his indispensable companion and other characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble yourself piece by piece</h2>.Yes, you are an ordinary skeleton, an outsider, but you have a specialty - you can replace your body parts with body parts of defeated enemies. A couple of successful battles and you are already half an invincible monster, a third a zombie and a third a witch on your grandmother's side. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/2bc88355fdf1b787e19da45044bdad3a.poster.avif?t=1739666632\" width=598 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/2bc88355fdf1b787e19da45044bdad3a.webm?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/2bc88355fdf1b787e19da45044bdad3a.mp4?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Found and knocked out body parts have different rarity, which depends on the main characteristics and unique passive effects. To put it simply, if you like to change the strategy of the game, to be a tank or a mage - there is something to play with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/4ff521928807be767aa2cb8f449aa674.poster.avif?t=1739666632\" width=598 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/4ff521928807be767aa2cb8f449aa674.webm?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/4ff521928807be767aa2cb8f449aa674.mp4?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get special skills</h2>.How about breathing fire, turning to stone, or summoning a swarm of disgusting flies to your aid? Easy, all you have to do is defeat an enemy and get his head or torso on you. Although a little luck is needed here too.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/acb310c7187e59771103c15fe6d4ffe2.poster.avif?t=1739666632\" width=598 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/acb310c7187e59771103c15fe6d4ffe2.webm?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/acb310c7187e59771103c15fe6d4ffe2.mp4?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutate</h2>.By defeating enemies, you accumulate internal power and voila, you can choose a special mutation of your character. For example, strengthen the skills you use, improve basic attacks, add a stun chance, and more. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/f2c94bc57bdef1d1576e26657598a809.poster.avif?t=1739666632\" width=598 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/f2c94bc57bdef1d1576e26657598a809.webm?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/f2c94bc57bdef1d1576e26657598a809.mp4?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get to know the mysterious world</h2>The action of the prologue takes place in the library. It's a confusing location with its own traps and secrets, and of course dust, magic and books not handed in on time. Perhaps the library is the perfect place to learn more about the world of Allaar.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And say that again</h2>.Death is commonplace in the world of Allaar. Yes, you'll lose everything you've gained, but you won't lose your experience as a player. The second attempt will be better than the first, and on the fifth time you can even get one eyeful of the boss. The main thing is that the attempts can be different from each other and if you like it, it is worth paying attention to Soulbind: Tales Of The Underworld, there you will find new enemies and new mechanics.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start the journey</h2>.The prologue is set before the story of the main game Soulbind: Tales Of The Underworld. You will learn where your hero's journey began, how he met his indispensable companion and other characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble yourself piece by piece</h2>.Yes, you are an ordinary skeleton, an outsider, but you have a specialty - you can replace your body parts with body parts of defeated enemies. A couple of successful battles and you are already half an invincible monster, a third a zombie and a third a witch on your grandmother's side. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/2bc88355fdf1b787e19da45044bdad3a.poster.avif?t=1739666632\" width=598 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/2bc88355fdf1b787e19da45044bdad3a.webm?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/2bc88355fdf1b787e19da45044bdad3a.mp4?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Found and knocked out body parts have different rarity, which depends on the main characteristics and unique passive effects. To put it simply, if you like to change the strategy of the game, to be a tank or a mage - there is something to play with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/4ff521928807be767aa2cb8f449aa674.poster.avif?t=1739666632\" width=598 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/4ff521928807be767aa2cb8f449aa674.webm?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/4ff521928807be767aa2cb8f449aa674.mp4?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get special skills</h2>.How about breathing fire, turning to stone, or summoning a swarm of disgusting flies to your aid? Easy, all you have to do is defeat an enemy and get his head or torso on you. Although a little luck is needed here too.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/acb310c7187e59771103c15fe6d4ffe2.poster.avif?t=1739666632\" width=598 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/acb310c7187e59771103c15fe6d4ffe2.webm?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/acb310c7187e59771103c15fe6d4ffe2.mp4?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutate</h2>.By defeating enemies, you accumulate internal power and voila, you can choose a special mutation of your character. For example, strengthen the skills you use, improve basic attacks, add a stun chance, and more. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/f2c94bc57bdef1d1576e26657598a809.poster.avif?t=1739666632\" width=598 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/f2c94bc57bdef1d1576e26657598a809.webm?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850630/extras/f2c94bc57bdef1d1576e26657598a809.mp4?t=1739666632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get to know the mysterious world</h2>The action of the prologue takes place in the library. It's a confusing location with its own traps and secrets, and of course dust, magic and books not handed in on time. Perhaps the library is the perfect place to learn more about the world of Allaar.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And say that again</h2>.Death is commonplace in the world of Allaar. Yes, you'll lose everything you've gained, but you won't lose your experience as a player. The second attempt will be better than the first, and on the fifth time you can even get one eyeful of the boss. The main thing is that the attempts can be different from each other and if you like it, it is worth paying attention to Soulbind: Tales Of The Underworld, there you will find new enemies and new mechanics.",
